Comment: The application is linked against the LVGL based cp0_lvgl runtime of the
 CardputerZero launcher by M5Stack (Copyright M5Stack Technology CO LTD, MIT) and LVGL
 (Copyright LVGL Kft, MIT), which are part of the binary and are therefore listed in
 its Copyright field below. No font is shipped or read: the text is drawn from a small
 bitmap font whose glyphs were made for this app.
 .
 The game (the board, the generator, the power and win rules, the scores) and the screen
 are the app's own code, written from scratch for this project from the public idea of a
 network-wiring puzzle; it contains no code, art or text of other programs of this kind.
 The generator uses the SplitMix64 mixing function (Sebastiano Vigna, public domain
 algorithm), implemented here from its published description.

